{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/equations-of-motion/","source":"students/subjects/physics/mechanics/equations-of-motion.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Equations of Motion | Physics Mechanics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700\">← Back to Mechanics</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Equations of Motion</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding uniform acceleration and motion under gravity</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"grid gap-8\">\n                <!-- Key Assumptions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Key Assumptions</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">These equations apply when:</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Acceleration is constant</li>\n                            <li>• Motion is in a straight line</li>\n                            <li>• Air resistance is negligible</li>\n                            <li>• No external forces (except gravity in free fall)</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Basic Equations -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Basic Equations of Motion</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Variable Definitions</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>v = final velocity (m/s)</li>\n                                        <li>u = initial velocity (m/s)</li>\n                                        <li>a = acceleration (m/s²)</li>\n                                        <li>t = time (s)</li>\n                                        <li>s = displacement (m)</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Four Basic Equations</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>v = u + at</li>\n                                        <li>s = ut + ½at²</li>\n                                        <li>v² = u² + 2as</li>\n                                        <li>s = ½(u + v)t</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Equation Applications -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">When to Use Each Equation</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">First Equation (v = u + at)</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Finding final velocity</li>\n                                        <li>• Known time period</li>\n                                        <li>• Constant acceleration</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Second Equation (s = ut + ½at²)</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Finding displacement</li>\n                                        <li>• Known time period</li>\n                                        <li>• Initial velocity known</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Motion Under Gravity -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Motion Under Gravity</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Free Fall</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Acceleration = 9.81 m/s² (g)</li>\n                                        <li>• Downward is positive</li>\n                                        <li>• Upward is negative</li>\n                                        <li>• Same for all masses</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Modified Equations</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• v = u + gt</li>\n                                        <li>• h = ut - ½gt²</li>\n                                        <li>• v² = u² - 2gh</li>\n                                        <li>• h = height, g = 9.81 m/s²</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Special Cases -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Special Cases</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Object Thrown Upward</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Initial velocity is positive upward</li>\n                                        <li>• Maximum height when v = 0</li>\n                                        <li>• Time up = time down</li>\n                                        <li>• Speed at start = speed at end</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Object Dropped</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Initial velocity = 0</li>\n                                        <li>• s = ½gt²</li>\n                                        <li>• v = gt</li>\n                                        <li>• v² = 2gh</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Problem-Solving Strategy -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Problem-Solving Strategy</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium\">List Known Variables</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm\">Write down all given values and identify what you need to find</p>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium\">Choose Correct Equation</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm\">Select equation that contains your unknown and known variables</p>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium\">Check Units</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm\">Convert all values to SI units before calculation</p>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium\">Solve and Check</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm\">Solve algebraically and verify if answer is reasonable</p>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practice Problems -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practice Problems</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Free Fall</p>\n                                <p>A ball is dropped from a height of 45 meters. Calculate:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Time taken to reach ground</li>\n                                    <li>Final velocity on impact</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Upward Throw</p>\n                                <p>A stone is thrown upward with initial velocity 15 m/s. Find:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Maximum height reached</li>\n                                    <li>Total time in air</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">General Motion</p>\n                                <p>A car accelerates uniformly from 10 m/s to 30 m/s in 5 seconds. Calculate:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>Distance traveled</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}